  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "By using **BODMAS Rule:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nOption 1) ×, ÷, =, +, −\n\nInterchange the mathematical signs with *,\n\nAfter placed the sign we get,\n\n⇒ 15 × __**1411 ÷ 83 **__= __**137 + 218**__ - 100\n\n⇒ __**15 × 17 **__= __**355 - 100**__\n\n⇒ **255 = 255**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ×, =, −, ÷, +\n\nInterchange the mathematical signs with *,\n\nAfter placed the sign we get,\n\n⇒ __**15 × 1411**__ = 83 - __**137 ÷ 218**__ + 100\n\n⇒ 21165 = __**83**__ - 0.62844 __**+ 100**__\n\n⇒ 21165 = __**183 - 0.62844**__\n\n⇒ 21165 ≠ 182.37456\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 3) +, −, ×, =, ÷\n\nInterchange the mathematical signs with *,\n\nAfter placed the sign we get,\n\n⇒ 15 + 1411 -__** 83 × 137**__ = __**218 ÷ 100**__\n\n⇒ __**15 + 1411**__ - 11371 = 2.18\n\n⇒ 1426 - 11371 = 2.18\n\n⇒ **-9945 ≠ 2.18**\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 4) ×, +, ÷, −, =\n\nInterchange the mathematical signs with *,\n\nAfter placed the sign we get,\n\n⇒ 15 × 1411 + __**83 ÷ 137 **__- 218 = 10\n\n⇒ __**15 × 1411**__ + 0.60583941 - 218 = 10\n\n⇒ __**21165 + 0.60583941**__ - 218 = 10\n\n⇒ 21165.60583941 - 218 = 10\n\n⇒ 20947.60583941 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 1\".**",
